{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ更新遅れてごめんなさい\n待っててもらえたかな......？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな事が沢山あったから、１つずつ行きます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前、名古屋のマンモスフリーマーケットのイベントに出させていただきましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨の中、沢山の方が来てくださっててビックリしました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪ひいてないですか？\nコメントにも体調くずしてるって書いてあったから、早く良くなるようにまあやパワー送ります〜！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来られない方の気持ちもいつも\nもらえて嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑新曲衣装\nリクエストがあったので、広島弁で........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「この衣装ぶち可愛いいじゃろ〜！可愛くない！ってゆうたら、はぶてるんじゃけ〜な〜！」...笑笑笑\n広島弁で書いてみたけど...伝わるかな!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーの新曲、\n《春のメロディー》も発披露させてもらったりしたよー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうでしたか〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い曲で、ダンスも可愛いので、もっともっと皆に見てもらいたいな〜！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー同士で、フリーマーケットいきたいねぇ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかって話してたんだ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か買って帰った方がいますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日は《似顔絵会》\n皆さんの似顔絵を書かせて頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書いてて思ったけど、まあやは絵が下手だ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんな絵で楽しんで帰ってもらえたのかなぁ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...汗汗\nでも、あんなに長く一緒に居れる事が出来て、まあやは楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに、あの会場は久しぶりでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あそこでオーディションがあって、\nお見立て会があって、\n控え室もオーディションの時と同じで、オーディションの時を思い出しました\nなんだか当分前の事みたいに感じた..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時の気持ちを思い出しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあそこの会場でイベントとかしたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、教えてくれてありがとうございます。...ブログ更新一周年..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも励ましてくれて、勇気を沢山もらったから今までやってこれたよ..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族と同じように大切な人達です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやが幸せな気持ちになるから、\nその何倍も幸せになってほしいです\n本当にいつもありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、よかったら、まあやと一緒に楽しんでもらえたら嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんでもらえるように、まあやは努力するよ!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな\nゆみ姉"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とうとう来てしまった...\n前みたいに乃木坂として一緒にお仕事することはないと思うけど、お互い頑張ろうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとまあやのお姉ちゃんだからね..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹の事心配して遊びに来てね..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉の印象は\nゲーム＆大人\nって感じ、見るたびにゲームしてた〜笑\nでも相談すると大人の考えを持ってるから凄く勉強になるし、ゆみ姉には、なんだか社会の勉強を教えてもらった感じがするなぁ←歴史とかそういうのじゃないよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人の社会みたいな感じ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、絶対に遊ぼうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんど泊まりに行きたいなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもずっと大好きな乃木坂のお姉ちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！前回のセクシーな脚は...\nいつも私達の心に元気をお届けものしてくれる〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらりん〜！でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0011.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}